Subject: [mistral.rs] vendor-sampling-defaults

  A sampling field the client omitted is answered by the MODEL's own shipped `generation_config.json` before the API's default can stand in for it, applied once on the single path every HTTP handler already sends through
  Without it an OpenAI client that sends no temperature is served at 1.0 with every truncation disabled, which it cannot see and did not ask for.

Applies to: 962112d18ea5729fe7acaae5085ce54c2fb66dab
